# Apple Health Export Lookup

When the user says they saved or uploaded a fresh Apple Health export:

1. First list `~/Library/Mobile Documents/com~apple~CloudDocs/Health data` by modification time.
2. Pick the newest `export*.zip` file, for example `export 4.zip`.
3. Then inspect or extract `export.xml` from that archive.

Do not start with only `export.xml`, `HealthAutoExport*.json`, or filename patterns containing `health`. The standard Apple Health archive can have a neutral name such as `export 4.zip`.
